<tr>
	<td class="bug_description add_padding_15" data-label="Description" >
	<p class="search_title add_margin_8">
		<a geck_id="4133964" class="ebr_modal" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#ebrModal" href="https://www.mathworks.com/support/bugreports/#ebrModal"><span class="visually-hidden">Bug Number</span>
			<strong>4133964: Incorrect Code Generation: With Boolean inputs, the generated HDL code for the Extract Bits block does not match the simulation results.</strong>
		</a>
	</p>
	<p class="add_margin_8">
		When your model contains an Extract Bitsblock with a Boolean input, the generated HDL code can produce a simulationmismatch. This occurs because the Simulink block treats the Boolean input as auint8 signal, while the HDL code interprets it as a 1-bit signal.     
	</p>
	<p>
